<title>FINLAND: VIKING 6-MTH PROFIT SURGES TO FIM 33.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>VIKING 6-MTH PROFIT SURGES TO FIM 33.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, tax	   33.2 vs 11.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		    2.1 vs 0.4</p>
<p> Net sales					  860.8 vs 841.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				  33.6 vs 0.2 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	74.5 vs 40.5</p>
<p> Depreciation					40.9 vs 40.6</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 0.4 vs 11.9 gain</p>
<p> Taxes						 10.5 vs 6.9</p>
<p> Net profit					  22.7 vs 4.8</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    33.9 vs 38.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish passenger ferry operator is</p>
<p>Viking Line Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0245</p>
</text>
